    <briefdescription>
<para>TCP Acceptor类 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>实现TCP服务器的连接接受功能，负责监听端口并接受客户端连接。 继承自ip_socket，提供专门用于服务器端的操作。</para>
<para>主要功能：<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>绑定到本地端点</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>开始监听连接</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>接受客户端连接</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>使用示例： <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>TCP服务器示例</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classneforce_1_1tcp__acceptor_1a5fdb5d31b3b0feeaffb3f245f0eab04e" kindref="member">tcp_acceptor</ref><sp/>acceptor;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>绑定并监听端口</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>endpoint<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classneforce_1_1ip__address_1ad0825eec9e113606606fe5f72a625413" kindref="member">ip_address::any</ref>(ports(8080));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">acceptor.open(endpoint,<sp/>128);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">acceptor.set_nonblocking(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="group___console_i_o_1ga9c4e1ac58957b1892c3091006222f66b" kindref="member">println</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Server<sp/>listening<sp/>on<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>endpoint);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">try</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>接受客户端连接</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>client<sp/>=<sp/>acceptor.accept_nonblock();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(client)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>获取客户端地址</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>client_addr<sp/>=<sp/>client.remote_endpoint();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(client_addr)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group___console_i_o_1ga9c4e1ac58957b1892c3091006222f66b" kindref="member">println</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;New<sp/>connection<sp/>from<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>client_addr);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>处理客户端请求</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">char</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>buffer[1024];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group___platform_dependent_types_1gaee9aeee261c91caa424e5eb0ec5bb749" kindref="member">ssize_t</ref><sp/>received<sp/>=<sp/>client.receive({buffer,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">sizeof</highlight><highlight class="normal">(buffer)});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(received<sp/>&gt;<sp/>0)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>client.send_all({</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Hello<sp/>from<sp/>server!&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">catch</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>exception&amp;<sp/>e)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group___console_i_o_1ga9c4e1ac58957b1892c3091006222f66b" kindref="member">println</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Accept<sp/>error:<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>e.what());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>默认启用地址重用选项，允许在关闭后立即重用端口。 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
